{"track":"python","category":"함수 만들기 ② 조건·반복·리스트","level":2,"title":"절댓값 직접 구하기","desc":"<p><code>abs()</code>를 쓰지 않고 수 <code>n</code>의 <b>절댓값</b>을 돌려주는 함수 <code>my_abs(n)</code>을 만드세요.</p>","starter":"def my_abs(n):\n    pass\n","solution":"def my_abs(n):\n    if n < 0:\n        return -n\n    return n\n","hint":"<p>음수이면 부호를 바꿔서(<code>-n</code>) 돌려줘요.</p>","tests":[{"call":"my_abs(5)","expected":5,"visible":true},{"call":"my_abs(-5)","expected":5,"visible":true},{"call":"my_abs(0)","expected":0,"visible":false},{"call":"my_abs(-2.5)","expected":2.5,"visible":false}],"id":"py-284"}